      "text": "[6:35PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic flow from UBA Roundabout and NNPC Filling Station.\nGood traffic conditions observed at Cathedral Church.\nUnimpeded traffic movement from State House inward to McWen and connecting Force Road.\nGood traffic flow from Zone 2 Underneath Bridge towards Flagstaff House, connecting to McWen Bridge.\nSmooth traffic movement from Onikan Roundabout by TBS onward to Water Board, connecting to Nitel Intersection.\nGood traffic conditions on Broad Street, from General Hospital towards Mr. Biggs by Joseph Harden Street.\nSlow traffic movement approaching Balogun Junction inward Apongbon.\nGood traffic conditions on Igbosere Road.\nSmooth traffic flow from Catholic Mission Street connecting Ganiu Smith Street.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
