      "text": "[6:47PM] #Anthony #TrafficUpdate \n\nImproved traffic movement from the foot of Dorman Long Bridge inw Fadeyi, Onipanu, down to Palm Grove, Obanikoro, and up to Anthony.\nSmooth traffic flow from Anthony inward to Idiroko, Maryland, Odo Iyalaro, and up to New Garage.\nGood traffic conditions on the return journey from the Interchange, Motorway down to Ojota, with both the service lane and main carriageway experiencing unimpeded traffic flow.\nUninterrupted traffic movement from Ojota down to New Garage, Odo Iyalaro, Independence Tunnel, and further down to Idiroko, Anthony, Obanikoro, Palm Grove, inward Onipanu, and up to Fadeyi.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
